  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Derby decorations</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/00/Shop_Rewards.png/revision/latest?cb=20171021181302\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Rewards tab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rewards tab\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Rewards tab</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Derby decorations</b> can only be won by participating in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a>. All but trophies and time-limited rewards are randomly obtained. Some are easier to obtain in higher leagues. Trophies can be won by <a href=\"/wiki/achievements-6714\" title=\"Achievements\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">achieving</a> Derby Champ I, II and III.\n</p><p>Derby decorations are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 18.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AAgility_Tire.png\" title=\"Agility Tire.png (233 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/ff/Agility_Tire.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20180412155634\" title=\"Agility Tire.png (233 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Agility Tire\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"A